{"path":"io/basic_ifstream/swap","title":"std::basic_ifstream<CharT,Traits>::swap","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::basic_ifstream&lt;CharT,Traits&gt;::</span>swap","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/io/basic_ifstream/swap","section":"io","kind":"page","summary":"Exchanges the state of the stream with those of other.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx11\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">void</span> swap<span class=\"br0\">(</span> basic_ifstream<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> other <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(since C++11)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Exchanges the state of the stream with those of <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">other</span></code>.\n</p><p>This is done by calling <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">basic_istream<span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>CharT, Traits<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">swap</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>other<span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code> and <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">rdbuf<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy2\">-</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span>swap<span class=\"br0\">(</span>other.<span class=\"me1\">rdbuf</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> other\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> stream to exchange the state with\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p>(none)\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Exceptions\">Exceptions</h3>\n<p>May throw implementation-defined ex